This product is a derivative work.

The WhatsApp service layer under src/services/ and src/models/ originates in
whatsapp-pi, a WhatsApp extension for the Pi coding agent:

    whatsapp-pi
    Copyright (c) 2025 Rapha
    https://github.com/RaphaCastelloes/whatsapp-pi
    Licensed under the MIT License

That code is reused here substantially unchanged. The only modified file is
src/services/storage-path.ts, where the storage root was repointed from the Pi
extension's directory to ~/.claude/channels/whatsapp/ and the former is kept as
the legacy root so existing credentials migrate on first run.

Added by this project: the Claude Code channel layer (server.ts, src/channel/),
the permission relay, the stdout guard, and the access skill.
